r at the head of an economic empire, who for an absurd reason blows up what for the Brutito is the business of life. For the first time, the Ugly one feels the pinch, falls into depression, can no longer find a reason to wake up in the morning. The turning point comes from Brera, a longtime friend, who proposes to the Bruttito the purchase of a Chiringuito in Sardinia, to do business in flip-flops and finally be able to say: \"I quit everything and open a chiringuito!\""}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eYa8gnPgq2hmmH3gqA3acJ6KUek.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/216FdYBh4HZPcZda4m4SasWe9lg.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":839287,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eYa8gnPgq2hmmH3gqA3acJ6KUek.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eYa8gnPgq2hmmH3gqA3acJ6KUek.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eYa8gnPgq2hmmH3gqA3acJ6KUek.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eYa8gnPgq2hmmH3gqA3acJ6KUek.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nabJz6FGeshlB5KhztysODLnvym.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nabJz6FGeshlB5KhztysODLnvym.jpg","language":"it","width":534,"height":800},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dyjhzTRbdneLbuJAM2GTic3lftM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dyjhzTRbdneLbuJAM2GTic3lftM.jpg","language":"it","width":690,"height":1035},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o1E6vr8FwrCaJESiTJNXDwD1LIj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o1E6vr8FwrCaJESiTJNXDwD1LIj.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"mi